---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Website Terms" description="Terms for using the Netsums website.">
  <section class="py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2">Website Terms</h1>
      <p class="text-sm mb-8" style="color:#94a3b8">Last updated: September 8, 2026</p>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-8" style="background-color:#132d52; color:#94a3b8">
        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed" style="color:#e2e8f0;"><strong class="text-white">Buying a membership?</strong> These terms cover general use of this website (netsums.com). Paid memberships and the exam-preparation service at pass.netsums.com are governed by the separate <a href="https://pass.netsums.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#5ce1e6">Netsums Terms of Service</a>, which set out price, access, and your right of withdrawal and money-back guarantee. If those product terms and these website terms ever conflict on a membership matter, the product terms apply.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">1. Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed">This website is operated by Ricardo Carvalho, trading under the business name Netsums as a sole proprietor (Einzelunternehmer) in Germany. Our full contact and legal details are in our <a href="/imprint" style="color:#5ce1e6">Imprint</a>.</p>

