          <li>copy, scrape, republish, or resell our content except as expressly allowed;</li>
          <li>use our content to build, train, or evaluate any dataset, model, or competing product;</li>
          <li>disrupt, overload, probe, or attempt to gain unauthorised access to the site or its infrastructure;</li>
          <li>use the site in any way that breaks applicable law or infringes the rights of others.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">3. Newsletter and contact form</h2>
        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed">If you subscribe to our newsletter or send us a message, we handle your details as described in our <a href="/privacy-policy" style="color:#5ce1e6">Privacy Policy</a>. You can unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time using the link in any email we send.</p>

