        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed">The website and its content are owned by us or our licensors. We grant you a personal, non-transferable, non-exclusive licence to view the content for your own information and study. All other rights are reserved.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed">&ldquo;Palo Alto Networks&rdquo; and related exam and product names are trademarks of their respective owners and are used only to identify the exams our materials help you prepare for. Netsums is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Palo Alto Networks.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">5. No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed">Our content, including any free practice material, is provided for general information and study only. Some practice questions are generated with the help of AI from publicly available documentation and then reviewed, and may still contain errors. The website and its content are provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo;, without warranty of accuracy, completeness, or fitness for a particular purpose, to the extent permitted by law. We do not promise, and cannot guarantee, that using our materials will result in passing any exam.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">6. Links to other websites</h2>
        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed">This website may link to third-party sites we do not control. We are not responsible for their content, policies, or practices, and we encourage you to review their terms and privacy policies.</p>

