        <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed">We may update these website terms from time to time. If we make a material change, we will update the date above. Continuing to use the website after a change takes effect means you accept the updated terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">9. Governing law</h2>
